{
  "about": "PLAN 3.5e: the hand picked candidate moves from yuhonas/free-exercise-db (Unlicense) that are not in data/catalog.json yet. scripts/build-candidates.ts turns this list into data/catalog-candidates.json. A candidate is never used anywhere until G approves it on the Review screen (src/data/candidateGate.ts). Each entry is the source id, then flags: '+a/b' adds a gear need (any of the listed equipment ids), 'bench' = +flat_bench/adjustable_bench, 'incline' = +adjustable_bench, 'each' counts each side, 'timed' counts seconds, 'reps' counts reps even for a static source entry, 'sh:front|rear|side|cuff|out' says which part of the shoulders the source's 'shoulders' means, 'load:<kind>' and 'bar:<id>' set how it is loaded. Groups are the 17 movement patterns of data/patterns.json (these join the swap ladders once approved) plus cardio, mobility, power and accessory (shown in the review and the coverage report, never in a ladder). Skipped on purpose: olympic lifts and strongman events (technique heavy, unsafe for a general app), anything needing gear the app has no item for (medicine ball, exercise ball, foam roller, sled, chains, boxes, suspension straps, a hack squat or preacher machine), behind the neck presses and pulldowns, partner moves, decline bench moves (a decline is not on every adjustable bench) and near duplicates of a catalog move or of another candidate.",
